    "title": "Fly Your Flag: Mayor issues call to action - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By CHARLES WHISNAND cwhisnand@portervillerecorder.com ,\n12 hours ago Porterville mayor Greg Meiser has issued a call to action for everyone in the community to fly their American flag in honor of the nation's 250th birthday. \"For 250 years, the American flag has stood as the symbol of freedom, sacrifice, courage, and unity,\" Meister said. \"It has flown over battlefields where brave men and women gave their lives so future generations could know the blessings of liberty. It has flown over schools, homes, churches, farms, factories, and communities built by hardworking Americans from every walk of life who believed in something greater than themselves. Read full article\n1",
